flowchart LR
    A[ar cr libfoo.a] --> B[Create archive]
    B --> C[Add object files]
    B --> D[Create symbol table]
    
    C --> E[foo.o]
    C --> F[bar.o]
    C --> G[baz.o]
    
    D --> H[ranlib libfoo.a, or ar s libfoo.a]
    
    I[Application] --> J[gcc app.c -L. -lfoo]
    J --> K[Linker extracts needed, objects from archive]
    K --> L[Copies into executable]
    
    style L fill:#c8e6c9
    style E fill:#fff9c4
    style F fill:#fff9c4
    style G fill:#fff9c4
